#. ボクは諦めたりしない。
#. 飽きたりしない。捨てたりしない。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I refuse to give up. I refuse to get bored! I refuse\n"
"to throw it all away!"
msgstr ""

#. 絶望なんかしない！！
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I refuse to despair!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、前向きなのが、
#. ボクの唯一の取り柄なんだ！
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because all I have going for me is the desire to keep\n"
"moving forward!"
msgstr ""

#. なん…なのよ…！
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What's...going on...?"
msgstr ""

#. なんなのよぉぉぉぉぉぉぉおおおおおおッ！！
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What's happeniiiing!?"
msgstr ""

#. …これで終わりのようだな。
#. では、そろそろ投票タイムか。
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It looks like we've reached the end. I think it may be\n"
"time to vote..."
msgstr ""

#. 手元のスイッチで投票すりゃいいんだべ？
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "We just gotta pull the lever, right?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…押しちゃうよ…！
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Good! I'm ready to go!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！！
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeehahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. 終わらせましょう…
#. 学級裁判を…この殺し合いを…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Let's put an end to these trials. Put an end to the\n"
"killing..."
msgstr ""

#. …私達の手でね。
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...with our own hands."
msgstr ""
